your own message

00:13:28.306 --> 00:13:30.042 align:start size:84% position:16%
- is what put it
  over the top for me.
- Yeah.

00:13:30.075 --> 00:13:32.110 align:start size:94% position:6%
- So, I think this is dope.
- Dope for sure.

00:13:32.143 --> 00:13:33.612
<i> ( music playing )</i>

00:13:33.645 --> 00:13:36.181
Camera:
<i> ( laughs ) Smile!</i>

00:13:36.214 --> 00:13:39.484 align:start size:88% position:13%
All right, next up
