00:14:34.272 --> 00:14:36.609 align:start position:0%
8x10 film holder
and processor.

00:14:38.610 --> 00:14:40.579 align:start position:0%
Huh.

00:14:40.612 --> 00:14:42.347 align:start position:0%
Ten negatives,
ten positives.

00:14:42.380 --> 00:14:43.615
- Four of these.
- I can't imagine

00:14:43.648 --> 00:14:45.050 align:start size:59% position:41%
