00:14:56.161 --> 00:14:58.430 align:start position:0%
Oh, I've always wanted
to push one of these.

00:14:58.463 --> 00:15:01.099 align:start size:59% position:41%
So, the funny thing
with these cameras

00:15:01.132 --> 00:15:03.335 align:start position:0%
