00:15:03.368 --> 00:15:05.938 align:start position:0%
So, it's kind of like
backwards from digital.

00:15:05.971 --> 00:15:07.339 align:start position:0%
So, pick a pose
that you can hold,

00:15:07.372 --> 00:15:10.542 align:start position:0%
'cause when we nail focus,
you can't move.

00:15:10.575 --> 00:15:13.045 align:start size:78% position:22%
This is
my presidential portrait.

00:15:13.078 --> 00:15:14.713 align:start position:0%
Here we go.
Oh, wow.

00:15:14.746 --> 00:15:16.615 align:start position:0%
This is insane.

00:15:16.648 --> 00:15:19.351 align:start size:69% position:31%
That is all set. Boom.

00:15:19.384 --> 00:15:21.019 align:start size:59% position:41%
Oh, it's happening.

00:15:21.052 --> 00:15:22.521 align:start position:0%
Drop the holster in.

00:15:22.554 --> 00:15:25.090 align:start size:97% position:3%
- I have to itch my shoulder.
- Don't move.

00:15:25.123 --> 00:15:27.292 align:start size:78% position:22%
- ( clicks )
- I saw it click.

00:15:27.325 --> 00:15:29.027 align:start size:91% position:9%
- Yeah, we did it.
- I think we took a photo.

00:15:29.060 --> 00:15:31.163 align:start size:69% position:31%
- Okay.
- ( sighs )

00:15:31.196 --> 00:15:33.332 align:start size:81% position:19%
So now we bring it over
to our developing station.

