- Of course we do.

00:15:44.175 --> 00:15:46.412
( whirring )

00:15:48.480 --> 00:15:51.316 align:start size:94% position:6%
- That's it.
- Let's see our masterpiece.
  Let's see it.

00:15:51.349 --> 00:15:54.453 align:start size:84% position:16%
- Oh, there it is.
- McKinnon: Bam.
  A little light leak.

00:15:54.486 --> 00:15:57.122 align:start position:0%
There's a light right behind me
when we took the photo,

00:15:57.155 --> 00:15:58.557 align:start position:0%
so it's like
a little flare, actually.

00:15:58.590 --> 00:16:01.460 align:start size:91% position:9%
