00:17:51.603 --> 00:17:54.206 line:0%
 Stern:<i> When I think about
 the first digital cameras,</i>

00:17:54.239 --> 00:17:57.476 line:0%
<i> you had Sony, Cannon,
 all these big names.</i>

00:17:57.509 --> 00:17:59.277 line:0%
Polaroid wasn't talked about.

00:17:59.310 --> 00:18:02.747
<i> When it came time for Polaroid
 to reinvent itself</i>

00:18:02.780 --> 00:18:04.883
<i> for it to take itself
 into the future,</i>

00:18:04.916 --> 00:18:06.552 line:0%
they were flat-footed.

00:18:07.785 --> 00:18:09.387 line:0%
Brian Williams:
<i> And now to something</i>

